  "description": "Don't miss the opportunity to view this EXCLUSIVE double storey 2-bedroom townhouse in the heart of Northbridge. But be quick, homes offering modern open plan design, large bedrooms and amazing lifestyle choices on your doorstep are leasing FAST.<br/><br/>The home is located within close proximity to restaurants, cafes, shops, public transport and schools. You will find yourself just 900m from the beautiful Hyde Park, 1km to the Northbridge restaurant and cafe strip and less than 2km to Perth CBD.<br/><br/>Apartment features include:<br/>- Executive 2x1 townhouse boasting secure low maintenance living<br/>- Open plan kitchen and dining area downstairs<br/>- Separate living room<br/>- Modern kitchen with gas cooktop plenty of storage space<br/>- Spacious courtyard perfect for entertaining or alfresco dining<br/>- 2 large bedrooms upstairs with built-in wardrobes<br/>- Main bathroom located upstairs with bath and a separate toilet<br/>- Laundry and additional toilet downstairs<br/>- 1 secure car bay<br/>- Storage shed<br/>- Air conditioning<br/>- Secure, low maintenance living <br/>- LOCATION, LOCATION LOCATION! Offering plenty of amazing lifestyle choices in the heart of Northbridge.<br/><br/>This MODERN home presents a fantastic opportunity for a small family or professionals looking for a great work-life balance. Don't let this opportunity slip away! Contact the PPM team TODAY on 6261 0666 to book an appointment to view this amazing home! Alternatively, you can schedule a home open through our online booking system by clicking on the \"Book an Inspection Time\" button.<br/><br/>Perth Property Management, offering Perth Rentals and Property Management Services in Perth and metro suburbs<br/>",
